 does seem like everybody pretty much  sees the same thing that we are headed  to secret wars the next big avengers end  game and infinity war level event except  this event will be bigger than ever  because it won't just have all of the  groups teaming up together like the  avengers the guardians spider-man but we  are going to have different variants of  them and multiple variants of them show  up as well plus not to mention the  fantastic four and the mutants so  imagine seeing all of those groups but  also seeing different variants of them  fight alongside them as well that's a  very exciting thing to be looking  forward to right now and she hulk could  also start that as well now the big  connection to avengers secret wars and  dr doom in the she-hulk series is  actually the villain titania played by  jamila jamil she actually has a direct  and very big connection to doctor doom  in the comics in fact dr doom is the  person who gives her her powers then she  fights alongside doctor doom in secret  wars let me explain how this happens now  in the comics titania's real name is  mary mcferrin and she was born  prematurely and she grew up scrawny and  short and she wasn't very wealthy in  fact she had to work a job to help  support her family and she was bullied a  lot in school by the rich kids now one  day spider woman swings by and she has  red hair of course well mary had red  hair too so she told her friend that she  was actually spider woman which of  course was a lie but her friend ended up  telling a lot of other people who told a  lot of other people and word eventually  got around that mary was spider woman so  she gets invited to a very fancy party  by the cool rich kid vanessa at her  house and she of course soon realizes  that the only reason that she got  invited was because everybody thinks  that she is spider woman then at this  time the events of secret wars battle  world happen in the middle of the party  the ground rips open and becomes a part  o