en and of course  battle world hasn't happened yet so they  are going to have to retcon how exactly  she gets her powers the order of events  are obviously not going to be the same  but what can be the same is that she got  her powers from dr doom now i really  hope that this is hinted at a lot but i  do hope it's teased a lot kind of like  the mysterious employer from ant-man and  the wasp i hope it's somewhat the same i  hope they don't reveal this right away  but then by the end of the series they  reveal that the person behind titania  the person that gave her her powers is  victor von doom and i hope this goes  along with the thing popping up as well  and making the connection between the  fantastic four and doom now if you  haven't heard the rumors recently the  latest rumor states that jason seagal is  going to be playing the thing now i'm  actually a pretty big jason seagal fan  and i think that this would work keep in  mind he's gonna wear a mocap suit  whoever is gonna play the thing is going  to be playing a mocap suit the person  who plays the thing does not have to be  a very very big or buff dude even though  jason seagal is very tall but take a  look at mark ruffalo he's not really the  size of the hulk it's all mocap and we  know the mcu likes to add some comedy to  things and i think that having jason  segol play the thing would definitely  add some comedy especially when you have  a very serious mr fantastic most of the  time now the recent rumors state that  the thing is only going to communicate  with jennifer walters aka she-hulk via  his lawyer kind of like he has his own  lawyer to talk to lawyers for him but  rumor has it that jennifer walters is  going to be defending the thing in a  defamation case could this defamation  case be against victor von doom there  are obviously stories where they work  together could the mcu be playing off of  one of those stories something goes down  between them and the rest of the  fantastic fours they're all working  together and victor possibly sues seems  like a victor von doom thing to do to me  and perhaps victor von doom maybe even  gives titania her powers to go up  against the thing but instead she ends  up kind of going up against she-hulk  either way there is definitely a lot of  potential with she-hulk and its  connection to doctor doom and if these  rumors are true it could introduce the  fantastic four keep in mind miss marvel  we didn't really expect to be anything  huge as far as the big reveals are  concerned but at the very last scene of  the very last episode they name-dropped  mutants so it could be that in she-hulk  they could introduce the fantastic four  plus not to mention san diego comic-con  is next week and then it is followed up  by d23 where we're expecting some pretty  big reveals from marvel studios and  since the last thing kevin feige said in  the last 2019 san diego comic-con was  the mutants and the fantastic four we're  expecting an update but in the meantime  let me know what you think about this  connection to doctor doom and the rumors  about the thing showing up in she-hulk  be sure to let me know in the comments  down below don't forget to like the  video and subscribe so you don't miss  out on any of the latest videos and for  live updates you can follow me on  instagram and twitter as always thank  you all so much for watching woof  you

